@* Apiaries are deactivated, never deleted (docs/DECISIONS.md, D-04) *@
<div class="alert alert-info d-flex align-items-start" role="note" id="deactivation-note">
    <i class="mdi mdi-information-outline me-2 font-size-18"></i>
    <div>
        <strong>Apiaries are never deleted</strong>, so that honey traceability is preserved.
        To take an apiary out of use, <strong>deactivate</strong> it from the beekeeper's apiary list:
        its photos and honey productions are kept, it is shown greyed out as <em>Inactive</em>,
        and it is no longer counted as active on the dashboard. <strong>Activate</strong> restores it.
    </div>
</div>
